@startuml components_telemetry_tmpfs
!include ../../../design/theme.iuml

title Telemetry tmpfs IPC Architecture (ADR-0037)

frame "GoCache Server" as Server {

  rectangle "Command hot path" as hotpath {
    component "Command\nGoroutine" as CmdGoro <<per-connection>>
    component "Slot Tracker" as SlotTracker <<zero-alloc ring\n(ADR-0034)>>
  }

  rectangle "Drain path (SIMPLIFIED)" as drain {
    component "Drain Worker" as DrainWorker <<protobuf serializer\nio.MultiWriter\nNO materialization\nNO context map>>
    component "Tmpfs Writer" as TmpfsWriter <<mmap /dev/shm\nsequential write>>
    component "Socket\nCoordinator" as SocketCoord <<TelemetryAck{consumed_offset}\nTelemetryAck>>
  }
}

database "/dev/shm/\ngocache-telemetry-<plugin>" as ShmFile <<tmpfs\n15M ceiling\nsequential bytes>>

frame "Observability Plugin\n(instrumentation / lifecycleotlp)" as Plugin {
  component "Socket Reader" as SockReader <<coordination only>>
  component "Tmpfs Reader" as TmpfsReader <<pread at offset>>
  component "Context\nReconstructor" as CtxRecon <<delta state machine\nTag{keyLen,keyBytes,\nvalLen,valBytes}>>
  component "OTLP Converter" as OtlpConv
  component "Exporter" as Exporter <<HTTP/gRPC>>
}

cloud "Jaeger /\nOTLP Backend" as Backend

' --- Command hot path (unchanged) ---
CmdGoro --> SlotTracker : RecordTelemetry\n(TelemetryRecord bytes)

' --- Drain path (NEW: stripped) ---
SlotTracker --> DrainWorker : completed operation\n(records []TelemetryRecord)
DrainWorker --> TmpfsWriter : serialized TelemetryOperation\nprotobuf (whole operation)\n(ZERO map alloc)
TmpfsWriter --> ShmFile : sequential write\n(mmap, ~200ns)

' --- Socket coordination (NEW: coordination only) ---
SockReader --> ShmFile : polls for new data

' --- Plugin read path (NEW) ---
SockReader --> TmpfsReader : wake up, read at offset
TmpfsReader --> ShmFile : pread(offset, length)
TmpfsReader --> CtxRecon : TelemetryOperation\n{opId, record bytes}
CtxRecon --> CtxRecon : apply Tag deltas\nreconstruct context map
CtxRecon --> OtlpConv : full operation\n+ materialized context
OtlpConv --> Exporter : OTLP spans/logs
Exporter --> Backend : OTLP HTTP/gRPC

' --- Ack path (NEW) ---
TmpfsReader --> SockReader : read complete
SockReader --> SocketCoord : TelemetryAck{consumed_offset}
SocketCoord --> TmpfsWriter : truncate consumed bytes
SocketCoord --> SockReader : ack confirm (compaction done)

note bottom of drain
  **REMOVED from drain worker (ADR-0036 path):**
  • copyOperationContext — map[string]string allocation
  • foldContextUpdate — string() from binary payload
  • 6 materialize functions — GCPC EventV1 construction
  • Event Bus → Plugin Bridge → Router FIFO → Transport

  The drain worker now does ONE thing:
  copy record bytes → write to tmpfs → done.
end note

note right of ShmFile
  **File format (whole operations):**
  [4-byte len][serialized TelemetryOperation protobuf]
  [4-byte len][serialized TelemetryOperation protobuf]
  ...

  TelemetryOperation proto = {
    operation_id: string
    initial_context: repeated Tag
    telemetry_items: repeated TelemetryItem
  }

  Tag = { key: bytes, value: bytes }

  initial_context = connection context
    snapshot at OpStart (the base).

  telemetry_items include ContextUpdate/
    ContextRemove deltas applied on top
    of initial_context.

  Serialized protobuf is the format.
end note

@enduml
